{"meta":{"id":"kitsu:51017","kitsu_id":"51017","type":"series","animeType":"ONA","name":"Umayuru: Full Gate!","slug":"umayuru-full-gate","aliases":["Umayuru: Full Gate!"],"genres":["Comedy"],"logo":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/-657d62e2a266f.png","poster":"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/51017/poster_image/medium-f303c9b616fec8519f723028578e702a.jpeg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt27429868/img","description":"\"Umayuru\" is a short anime series featuring pint-sized Uma Musume! This time, it’s a \"Full-Gate\" three-minute race where *all* the Uma Musume take to the track! A super-sized, laid-back gathering with everyone!","releaseInfo":"2026-","year":"2026-","userCount":33,"status":"current","runtime":"3 min","trailers":[],"videos":[{"id":"kitsu:51017:1","title":"Seven Heads Are Better than One","released":"2026-09-27T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/1/w780.jpg","overview":"The Solefall Faire is right around the corner! Special Week and the rest of the Golden Generation gather to come up with an event for the fans, but their ideas differ as much as their personalities!","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":1,"absoluteEpisode":33},{"id":"kitsu:51017:2","title":"Where Friendships Shine! Impressions Tournament!","released":"2026-10-04T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/2/w780.jpg","overview":"It's the day of the Solefall Faire, and BNW are up against Sakura Chiyono O, Yaeno Muteki, and Mejiro Ardan in an impressions tournament! Each team has the fiery power of friendship on their side, so who will come out on top?!","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":2,"absoluteEpisode":34},{"id":"kitsu:51017:3","title":"Let Your Passion Take Form!","released":"2026-10-11T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/3/w780.jpg","overview":"As the runners prepare artworks for the upcoming fan event, who should appear but the illustrious mistress of passion herself, Gold Ship! Thus begins the battle to see whose passion burns brightest!","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":3,"absoluteEpisode":35},{"id":"kitsu:51017:4","title":"Halloween Preparations","released":"2026-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/4/w780.jpg","overview":"After Sakura Laurel excitedly shows off her outfit for the Halloween costume contest, Sakura Chitose O wonders how best to celebrate the holiday herself. Perhaps seeing how the others prepare will give her some hints...","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":4,"absoluteEpisode":36},{"id":"kitsu:51017:5","title":"The Show Uma-st Go On!","released":"2026-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/5/w780.jpg","overview":"As the curtain (prematurely) rises, so too do the stars of the show! T.M. Opera O and company beguile the audience with a tale of passion and woe, but an unexpected tempest of fate brings about a finale that leaves everyone on the edge of their seat (cast included).","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":5,"absoluteEpisode":37},{"id":"kitsu:51017:6","title":"Oguri Goes on a Diet!","released":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt27429868/3/6/w780.jpg","overview":"Oguri Cap's eating habits have come back to bite her right before a race! Can her friends help her get down to an acceptable racing weight? Will Tamamo Cross have enough quips for the chaos that ensues?!","runtime":"3 min","imdb_id":"tt27429868","imdbSeason":3,"imdbEpisode":6,"absoluteEpisode":38},{"id":"kitsu:51017:7","title":"Dearest Grandmother","released":"2026-11-08T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":7,"th